<title>JAPAN: Japan Feb chain store sales fall 0.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Japan Feb chain store sales fall 0.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sales at Japanese chain stores in February fell 0.8 percent year-on-year to 1.21 trillion yen, the Japan Chain Stores Association said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The February figure was a 17.2 percent drop from January, the association said in a statement.</p>
<p>The association's survey covered 7,897 outlets of 132 companies.</p>
